Here is the commit message:
bugfix for 3661e14674124de2026216682372d9b99ae0fe28

Quantifiers are no Application terms any more.

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the incorrect handling of quantifiers in the Z3 solver, where quantifiers were treated as application terms. This led to improper behavior in methods that expected only application terms, resulting in potential errors or incorrect results when quantifiers were processed.

Here is the patch:

   @Override
